SUMMARY:Deadline: The Photographers' Gallery: Future of Archives\, Whose Ar
 chive is it Anyway? (Call for Speakers)
DESCRIPTION:Whose Archive is it Anyway? is the first in a three-part series
  of events at The Photographers' Gallery exploring the future of archives 
 and archiving.\n\nOrganisation: The Photographers' Gallery\nLocation: Lond
 on\, UK. Selected speakers must be available to speak in person at The Pho
 tographers' Gallery on 16 April 2027.\nAward: GBP 200 speaker fee for each
  selected speaker. No application fee.\nDuration: One-day event on Friday 
 16 April 2027\n\nMore: https://forms.cloud.microsoft/pages/responsepage.as
 px?id=Sykm7fNJbU-mcP8tt-A2n-2SkeDTc21FsI7ZwhvDxVtUNTc3RVExTjRRUDRUSVU5MzUz
 WDMwMlBQMC4u&route=shorturl&utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medi
 um=referral
URL:https://forms.cloud.microsoft/pages/responsepage.aspx?id=Sykm7fNJbU-mcP
 8tt-A2n-2SkeDTc21FsI7ZwhvDxVtUNTc3RVExTjRRUDRUSVU5MzUzWDMwMlBQMC4u&route=s
 horturl&utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:London\, UK. Selected speakers must be available to speak in perso
 n at The Photographers' Gallery on 16 April 2027.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:simons-foundation-open-interval-turbulence-2026@artificialnouveau.githu
 b.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T151759Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261021
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261022
SUMMARY:Deadline: Open Interval: An Artist-Scientist Exploration of Turbule
 nce
DESCRIPTION:Open Interval is a Simons Foundation program that supports trio
 s consisting of an artist\, a scientist\, and a representative from a 501(
 c)(3) arts organization to collaborate around a shared scientific theme. T
 he current cycle centers on the theme of turbulence\, a phenomenon at the 
 edge of chaos and beauty.\n\nOrganisation: Simons Foundation\nLocation: Un
 ited States (trio must be regionally co-located)\nAward: USD 30\,000 per a
 warded trio\nDuration: April to December 2027 (several months of collabora
 tion)\n\nMore: https://www.simonsfoundation.org/2026/06/01/coming-soon-ope
 n-interval-an-artist-scientist-exploration-of-turbulence/?utm_source=artif
 icialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.simonsfoundation.org/2026/06/01/coming-soon-open-interval-a
 n-artist-scientist-exploration-of-turbulence/?utm_source=artificialnouveau
 grantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:United States (trio must be regionally co-located)
END:VEVENT
