DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261103
SUMMARY:Deadline: ARC Prize 2026
DESCRIPTION:The ARC Prize Foundation runs its 2026 competition for progress
  toward artificial general intelligence\, with a USD 2\,000\,000 total pri
 ze pool across three tracks: the main Kaggle competition on the ARC-AGI-2 
 static reasoning benchmark\, a track on ARC-AGI-3 interactive agent reason
 ing (second milestone 30 September 2026)\, and a paper prize for research 
 that advances understanding of ARC-AGI...\n\nOrganisation: ARC Prize Found
 ation\nLocation: Online (Kaggle)\, worldwide\nAward: USD 2\,000\,000 total
  prize pool across three tracks (ARC-AGI-2\, ARC-AGI-3 agents\, and a pape
 r prize)\; milestone prizes include USD 25\,000 / 10\,000 / 2\,500\nDurati
 on: Competition runs through 2 November 2026 (paper track 8 November)\; re
 sults announced 4 December 2026\n\nMore: https://arcprize.org/competitions
 /2026?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://arcprize.org/competitions/2026?utm_source=artificialnouveaugran
 tdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Online (Kaggle)\, worldwide
